                                rem moved to environment-common-vars ➜ rem MP3BACKUP1DRIVE=%HD4000G2% %+ set MP3BACKUP1=%MP3BACKUP1DRIVE%:\BACKUPS\mp3
                                rem moved to environment-common-vars ➜ rem MP3BACKUP2DRIVE=%HD10000G2 %+ set MP3BACKUP2=%MP3BACKUP2DRIVE%:\BACKUPS\mp3
