                                        rem moved to environment-common-vars ➜ set MP3_BACKUP_2=%MP3BACKUP2%
                                        rem moved to environment-common-vars ➜ set MP3_BACKUP_3=%MP3BACKUP3%
                                        rem moved to environment-common-vars ➜ set MP3_SECONDARY=%MP3BACKUP3% %+ REM we call this one secondary because it's THAILOG's old music server (2015-2022)
                                        rem moved to environment-common-vars ➜ set MP3SECONDARY=%MP3_SECONDARY%
                                
                        rem music collection's Auxilary collection (where mp3s go when replaced by FLACs, among other things), and it's backup:
                                rem moved to environment-common-vars ➜ set            MP3AUX=%MP3OFFICIALDRIVE%:\mp3-aux %+ REM Must be on same drive as MP3OFFICIAL for reasons! This is a special repo for redundant files like .bak, .mp3 when there is a .flac, .mp3s that were .mp3.deprecated in the official repo
                                rem moved to environment-common-vars ➜ set MP3AUXBACKUPDRIVE=%MP3BACKUP1DRIVE% %+ set MP3AUXBACKUP=%MP3AUXBACKUPDRIVE%:\BACKUPS\mp3-aux
                                
