                                rem moved to environment-common-vars ➜ SET MP3VERSIONINGDRIVE=%MP3OFFICIALDRIVE%
                                rem moved to environment-common-vars ➜ SET MP3VERSIONING=%MP3VERSIONINGDRIVE%:\mp3-git-repo
