                                rem moved to environment-common-vars ➜ set  MUSICSERVERUSERNAME=cliocjs                        %+ rem 2024: This doesn't seem to be used as it's been wrong for years. #the Windows/OS-username that is logged in when the MUSICSERVER is playing music
                        
